      <lines>
      <chord name="Cm"/>Christ <chord name="Gm"/>is <chord name="Fm"/>made <chord name="Gm"/>the <chord name="Cm"/>sure <chord name="Gm"/>foundation,<br/>
      <chord name="Ab"/>Christ, <chord name="Gm"/>our <chord name="Fm"/>head and <chord name="Cm/G"/>cornerstone,<br/>
