      <chord name="Cm"/>And hereafter <chord name="Ab"/>in <chord name="Bb"/>Your <chord name="Cm"/>glory<br/>
      <chord name="Db"/>Evermore <chord name="Gm"/>with <chord name="Ab"/>You <chord name="Gm"/>to <chord name="Cm"/>reign.
